:: RobinTemple Chastity Widgets [widget]
<!-- 原版从不为罗宾配置贞操器具，因此 speech-robin / ejaculation-robin 里完全没有器具分支。
     罗宾的器具全部来自本模组的 Clasp 线。这里照原版 speech-SYDNEY / ejaculation-SYDNEY
     的写法补齐反应，再由 RobinTemple.ts 把对应 elseif 注入原版 widget。
     $speechNPCChastity = 罗宾被锁住（原版只在罗宾本人那格被锁时才置位）。$speechchastity = PC 被锁住。
     罗宾的语气基准见 Clasp.twee：「得去问约旦，不能自己摘」「我想自己说明白」「你陪我一起去，好吗？」
     所以他不会说 Sydney 的 break this thing / proper / senseless，也不会把每次高潮都变成催约旦。 -->

<<widget 'robin-chastity-speech-device'>>
  <!-- PC 碰到罗宾自己的器具。对应原版 Sydney 的 $speechNPCChastity。 -->
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 40>>
        <<print either(
          `"S-sorry." Robin pulls back, hands over <<his>> crotch. "I can't... it's the temple's. I'd have to ask."`,
          `"Don't," Robin whispers, flinching. "Not while it can't come off."`
        )>>
      <<elseif C.npc.Robin.dom gte 70>>
        <<print either(
          `Robin presses your hand flat against the belt and keeps it there. "It doesn't come off. That doesn't mean stop."`,
          `"If you want it gone, we go to Jordan together," Robin says. "I won't go behind his back."`
        )>>
      <<else>>
        <<print either(
          `Robin goes red and covers <<himself>>. "S-sorry. It's from the temple. Jordan would have to take it off."`,
          `"It's locked," Robin says, and looks away. "I can't just... I'd have to ask."`
        )>>
      <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 40>>
        <<print either(
          `“对、对不起。”罗宾缩回去，双手护着下面。“我……这是神殿的，得去问才行。”`,
          `“别，”罗宾小声说，缩了一下，“别在摘不下来的时候碰那里。”`
        )>>
      <<elseif C.npc.Robin.dom gte 70>>
        <<print either(
          `罗宾反而把你的手按在带子上，不让它挪开。“它摘不下来。这不代表要停。”`,
          `“你要是想让它下来，我们一起去找约旦，”罗宾说，“我不想瞒着他。”`
        )>>
      <<else>>
        <<print either(
          `罗宾满脸通红地护住自己。“对、对不起，这是神殿的。要摘得约旦动手。”`,
          `“锁着的，”罗宾别开脸，“我不能自己……得去问才行。”`
        )>>
      <</if>>
  <</language>>
<</widget>>

